    "close_panel_hint": "Right click anywhere to close",
    "economy_intro": "We are here to bring love to the humans. And the best way to do so is through music. So let create a Flute Player and let them hear its melody. With the love from the Flute Player, we can ceate more of us!",
    "lives_intro": "They took one of us! Our core in the hole can only survive 3 attacks, after that we are all doomed. And without our Flute Player, we couldnt generate love. We have to defend ourselfes",
    "tile_buying_intro": "Now we can protect the replaced Flute Player. This Stone Thrower attacks everything in its range. Lets buy another tile and create a second Stone Thrower so that they cover the most possible ground."
  },
